<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 3,674 packages of landed tea sold at this weeks London sale was 127.11 pence a kilo against 132.24 last week and 109.77 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 97,383 pkgs sold so far this year is 129.55 pence against 113.69 pence for the 129,244 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
